492 0 obj
  << /ActualText (1\056 Wi\055Fi Configuration\072 The participants discussed the configuration of Wi\055Fi settings\054 including setting up access points\054 routers\054 and passwords\056 They also mentioned the need for documentation and user manuals for reference\056 \13301\07241 \055 04\07254\135\015\n\015\n2\056 Network Topology\072 The meeting touched upon the network topology\054 specifically the connection of buses and instruments through Ethernet and Wi\055Fi\056 They discussed the need for waterproof and weatherproof equipment for outdoor installations\056 \13305\07242 \055 09\07219\135\015\n\015\n3\056 Modbus and Instrument Configuration\072 The participants mentioned the configuration of Modbus instruments and the need for proper calibration and settings\056 They also discussed the importance of setting the correct frequency and range for accurate measurements\056 \13310\07205 \055 15\07214\135\015\n\015\n4\056 Gateway and Internet Connectivity\072 The meeting covered the configuration of gateways and the establishment of internet connectivity\056 They discussed the use of static IP addresses and the need for proper network settings\056 \13315\07250 \055 19\07251\135\015\n\015\n5\056 Documentation and User Manuals\072 The participants emphasized the importance of having comprehensive documentation and user manuals for reference\056 They discussed the need for clear instructions on configuring and troubleshooting various devices and settings\056 \13320\07212 \055 23\07219\135\015\n\015\n6\056 Troubleshooting and Technical Support\072 The meeting touched upon troubleshooting issues and the need for technical support\056 They discussed the process of diagnosing and resolving problems\054 as well as the importance of having a support team available\056 \13323\07245 \055 26\07254\135\015\n\015\n7\056 Configuration of PLC and Controllers\072 The participants mentioned the configuration of PLCs and controllers\054 including setting up IP addresses and ensuring proper communication between devices\056 They also discussed the need for accurate calibration and testing\056 \13327\07220 \055 30\07242\135\015\n\015\n8\056 Security and Passwords\072 The meeting briefly touched upon the importance of security measures\054 including setting strong passwords and ensuring secure access to devices and networks\056 \13331\07210 \055 32\07206\135\015\n\015\n9\056 Network Stability and Performance\072 The participants discussed the need for stable and reliable network performance\056 They mentioned the importance of proper network design and configuration to ensure smooth operation and accurate data transmission\056 \13332\07230 \055 34\07212\135\015\n\015\n10\056 Network Monitoring and Management\072 The meeting briefly mentioned the need for network monitoring and management tools to track performance\054 identify issues\054 and make necessary adjustments\056 \13334\07230 \055 35\07200\135)
     /K [ 16 ]
     /P 493 0 R
     /Pg 460 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

